:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)]].''
:''Not to be confused with [[Manga Boogie Cat (Switch Special Cat)]].''
'''Boogie Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 90 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Italy (Empire of Cats)|Italy]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] gains a chance to knockback non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked when beating Gifu in chapter 2 and costs 14000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Boogie Cat is available for purchase when beating Italy in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 45 Cat Food.

